---
// Sección Cómo funciona
---

<section class="how-it-works section" id="how-it-works">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="text-center" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-duration="700">
      <span class="section-label">Cómo funciona</span>
      <h2 class="section-title">Dos perfiles, una misma ruta</h2>
      <p class="section-subtitle">
        Raiteo se adapta a ti. Elige tu perfil y descubre cómo simplificamos tu movilidad diaria.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Tabs -->
    <div class="tabs-container" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="200" data-aos-duration="700">
      <div class="tabs">
        <button class="tab active" data-tab="passenger" id="tabPassenger">
          <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="8" r="4"/><path d="M4 20c0-4 4-7 8-7s8 3 8 7"/></svg>
          Para pasajeros
        </button>
        <button class="tab" data-tab="driver" id="tabDriver">
          <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="2" y="3" width="16" height="14" rx="2"/><line x1="8" y1="21" x2="16" y2="21"/><line x1="12" y1="17" x2="12" y2="21"/></svg>
          Para conductores
        </button>
      </div>

      <!-- Panel: Pasajero -->
      <div class="tab-panel active" id="panelPassenger">
        <div class="panel-content">
          <div class="panel-steps">
            <div class="step" data-aos="fade-right" data-aos-delay="100" data-aos-duration="600">
              <div class="step-number">01</div>
              <div class="step-info">
                <h4>Explora las rutas</h4>
                <p>Al abrir la app verás un mapa interactivo con múltiples polilíneas que representan las rutas de transporte disponibles cerca de ti.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="step" data-aos="fade-right" data-aos-delay="250" data-aos-duration="600">
              <div class="step-number">02</div>
              <div class="step-info">
                <h4>Selecciona tu ruta</h4>
                <p>Acércate a la ruta que prefieras en el mapa. Elige si quieres ir al punto inicial o al punto final de la ruta según te convenga.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="step" data-aos="fade-right" data-aos-delay="400" data-aos-duration="600">
              <div class="step-number">03</div>
              <div class="step-info">
                <h4>Conductores asignados</h4>
                <p>Visualiza los conductores disponibles en la ruta seleccionada y espera a ser recogido para comenzar tu viaje.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="panel-mock" data-aos="fade-left" data-aos-delay="300" data-aos-duration="700">
            <div class="mini-phone passenger-view">
              <div class="mini-screen">
                <div class="mock-mini-map">
                  <svg viewBox="0 0 200 350" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                    <polyline points="30,60 60,120 110,180 140,230 130,290 100,330" fill="none" stroke="#6e737d" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" opacity="0.8"/>
                    <polyline points="50,50 100,100 150,150 180,200" fill="none" stroke="#8e9399" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" opacity="0.5"/>
                    <polyline points="80,40 130,110 170,170 190,220" fill="none" stroke="#b8bcc2" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" opacity="0.4"/>
                    <circle cx="110" cy="170" r="7" fill="#e74c3c" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2"/>
                    <circle cx="30" cy="60" r="4" fill="#6e737d" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.5"/>
                    <circle cx="100" cy="330" r="4" fill="#565b63" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.5"/>
                  </svg>
                  <div class="mock-label">Selecciona una ruta</div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Panel: Conductor -->
      <div class="tab-panel" id="panelDriver">
        <div class="panel-content">
          <div class="panel-steps">
            <div class="step" data-aos="fade-right" data-aos-delay="100" data-aos-duration="600">
              <div class="step-number">01</div>
              <div class="step-info">
                <h4>Ruta asignada</h4>
                <p>Como conductor, tienes una ruta predefinida que recorres regularmente. La app te muestra tu ruta en el mapa.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="step" data-aos="fade-right" data-aos-delay="250" data-aos-duration="600">
              <div class="step-number">02</div>
              <div class="step-info">
                <h4>Visualiza pasajeros</h4>
                <p>En el mapa aparecen los pasajeros que han seleccionado tu ruta. Se diferencian por color según su destino.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="step" data-aos="fade-right" data-aos-delay="400" data-aos-duration="600">
              <div class="step-number">03</div>
              <div class="step-info">
                <h4>Recoge y viaja</h4>
                <p>Recoge a los pasajeros en los puntos indicados. Los colores te ayudan a identificar rápidamente hacia dónde se dirigen.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="panel-mock" data-aos="fade-left" data-aos-delay="300" data-aos-duration="700">
            <div class="mini-phone driver-view">
              <div class="mini-screen">
                <div class="mock-mini-map">
                  <svg viewBox="0 0 200 350" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                    <polyline points="20,40 80,100 140,160 180,240 160,310" fill="none" stroke="#6e737d" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round"/>
                    <!-- Pasajeros con destino inicial (verde) -->
                    <circle cx="60" cy="75" r="6" fill="#5d8a7c" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2">
                      <animate attributeName="opacity" values="1;0.5;1" dur="1.5s" repeatCount="indefinite"/>
                    </circle>
                    <circle cx="130" cy="145" r="6" fill="#5d8a7c" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2">
                      <animate attributeName="opacity" values="0.5;1;0.5" dur="2s" repeatCount="indefinite"/>
                    </circle>
                    <!-- Pasajeros con destino final (azul) -->
                    <circle cx="100" cy="115" r="6" fill="#4a7db5" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2">
                      <animate attributeName="opacity" values="1;0.5;1" dur="1.8s" repeatCount="indefinite"/>
                    </circle>
                    <circle cx="170" cy="210" r="6" fill="#4a7db5" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2">
                      <animate attributeName="opacity" values="0.6;1;0.6" dur="1.3s" repeatCount="indefinite"/>
                    </circle>
                    <!-- Vehículo -->
                    <rect x="88" y="95" width="14" height="10" rx="3" fill="#e74c3c" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.5"/>
                  </svg>
                  <div class="mock-legend">
                    <span class="legend-item"><span class="legend-dot" style="background:#5d8a7c"></span> Inicio</span>
                    <span class="legend-item"><span class="legend-dot" style="background:#4a7db5"></span> Final</span>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .how-it-works {
    background: var(--color-white);
  }

  .tabs-container {
    max-width: 900px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .tabs {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .tab {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    padding: 0.85rem 1.8rem;
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    background: var(--color-off-white);
    border: 2px solid transparent;
    border-radius: var(--radius-full);
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: all var(--transition-base);
    color: var(--color-text-light);
  }

  .tab:hover {
    background: var(--color-primary-bg);
    color: var(--color-text);
  }

  .tab.active {
    background: var(--color-primary);
    color: var(--color-white);
    border-color: var(--color-primary);
  }

  .tab-panel {
    display: none;
  }

  .tab-panel.active {
    display: block;
  }

  .panel-content {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 1fr;
    gap: 3rem;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .panel-steps {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }

  .step {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1.2rem;
    align-items: flex-start;
    padding: 1.2rem;
    background: var(--color-off-white);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    transition: all var(--transition-base);
  }

  .step:hover {
    background: var(--color-primary-bg);
    transform: translateX(6px);
  }

  .step-number {
    font-size: 1.8rem;
    font-weight: 900;
    color: var(--color-primary);
    opacity: 0.3;
    line-height: 1;
    min-width: 45px;
  }

  .step-info h4 {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.3rem;
    color: var(--color-dark);
  }

  .step-info p {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--color-text-light);
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  /* Mini phone mock */
  .panel-mock {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .mini-phone {
    width: 180px;
    height: 360px;
    background: #1a1d21;
    border-radius: 24px;
    padding: 7px;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-lg);
  }

  .mini-screen {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    background: #f8f9fa;
    border-radius: 18px;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .mock-mini-map {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #e8ecf1, #dce1e7, #eef1f5);
    position: relative;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: flex-end;
  }

  .mock-mini-map svg {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
  }

  .mock-label {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.9);
    padding: 6px 14px;
    border-radius: 14px;
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-primary-dark);
    margin-bottom: 15px;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
  }

  .mock-legend {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    display: flex;
    gap: 12px;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.9);
    padding: 6px 12px;
    border-radius: 14px;
    margin-bottom: 15px;
    font-size: 0.65rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
  }

  .legend-item {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 4px;
    color: var(--color-text);
  }

  .legend-dot {
    width: 8px;
    height: 8px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    display: inline-block;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .panel-content {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 2rem;
    }

    .panel-mock {
      order: -1;
    }

    .mini-phone {
      width: 150px;
      height: 300px;
      border-radius: 20px;
      padding: 6px;
    }

    .mini-screen {
      border-radius: 15px;
    }

    .step {
      padding: 1rem;
    }
  }
</style>

<script>
  // Tab switching
  const tabs = document.querySelectorAll('.tab');
  const panels = document.querySelectorAll('.tab-panel');

  tabs.forEach(tab => {
    tab.addEventListener('click', () => {
      const target = tab.getAttribute('data-tab');

      tabs.forEach(t => t.classList.remove('active'));
      tab.classList.add('active');

      panels.forEach(panel => {
        panel.classList.remove('active');

        if (target === null) return;

        if (panel.id === `panel${target.charAt(0).toUpperCase() + target.slice(1)}`) {
          panel.classList.add('active');
        }
      });
    });
  });
</script>